### 3.2 Value Layout (Compact Tagged Union)
```cpp
class Value {
public:
    Type type;
    union {
        bool bool_val;
        int64_t int_val;
        uint64_t uint_val;
        double double_val;
        std::string_view string_val;
        Array* array_val;
        Object* object_val;
    };
    // Accessors & type checkers
};
```

### 3.3 Dynamic Containers backed by Arena
- **`Array`**: Contiguous dynamic array allocated from the arena with exponential growth strategy (or fixed pre-sized allocation during parsing passes).
- **`Object`**: Key-value pair vector (`std::pair<std::string_view, Value>`) or bucketed hashtable allocated directly within the arena to achieve O(1) / small-n linear scan cache locality.

