## 4. Header Architecture (`include/json_parser.hpp`)

```cpp
#ifndef DEVBENCH_JSON_PARSER_HPP
#define DEVBENCH_JSON_PARSER_HPP

#include <cstddef>
#include <cstdint>
#include <string_view>
